      },
      "message": "feat: log save, open, post, generation and commands to the terminal (tracing)\n\ncamcraft_app::logging::init() installs a tracing-subscriber fmt layer on\nstderr from both binaries, filtered by CAMCRAFT_LOG / RUST_LOG (default\ninfo, the GPU stack at warn). Project save/open name the path and size or\nwhy they failed; a post names the NC file, bytes, ops and time, or why\nnothing was written; every generation logs its op, kind, move count and\ntime, or its refusal; commands log at debug.\n\nRefs #163\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
