      },
      "message": "fix(app): log file names, not paths; saturate log durations\n\nReview items on PR #222: save/open/NC-write log lines name the file\nonly (logging::file_name), so a pasted log does not expose the user's\nfolder layout; generation and post durations go through\nlogging::elapsed_ms (u64::try_from, saturating at u64::MAX) instead of\n`as_millis() as u64`. The logging suite now also asserts the full paths\nare absent. Decision note in docs/decisions/163-tracing.md.\n\nRefs #163\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
